# No secrets are required for the dispatch worker.
# Bind a wildcard hostname to this worker in the Cloudflare dashboard:
#   DNS:   *.agents.example.com  →  192.0.2.0 (proxied)
#   Route: *.agents.example.com/* → crazp-dispatch
#
# Local: http://{workerName}.localhost:8788
#   The first hostname label is the script name in DISPATCH_NAMESPACE.
